   "source": [
    "# Phase M5 Video C: MU-Glioma Tumor Evolution Videos\n",
    "**Input:** `ddpm_v2_128_best.pth` + `mu_glioma_triplets.npz`\n",
    "**Output:** `.mp4` videos per patient showing tumor progression\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
